,"color":"color.text.tertiary","x":80,"y":84}},{"into":"","node":{"t":"text","name":"caption 02","chars":"state: status/partial-composite","typo":"type.ui.caption","color":"color.text.tertiary","x":766,"y":84}},{"into":"","node":{"t":"text","name":"caption 03","chars":"state: status/header-slot","typo":"type.ui.caption","color":"color.text.tertiary","x":1734,"y":84}},{"into":"","node":{"t":"text","name":"footer · data statement","chars":"Data: synthetic only where a board draws a profile — a seeded world (seed 382): BTCUSDT 30-minute periods over the UTC days 28 Oct, 29 Oct, 30 Oct 2026 (the last developing, as of 14:30 UTC), tick 0.10 and qty step 0.001 from the recorded instrument fixture; prices, volumes and buy shares synthetic; rows of 50 ticks (5.0 USDT) unless a frame says otherwise; every POC, VAH, VAL, node, count and time derived from the periods (value area 70 %, `22`'s single-step expansion). Research board: greyscale, dark only; every finding (heuristic), every decision PROPOSED; no session was run.","typo":"type.ui.caption","color":"color.text.secondary","x":80,"y":828,"w":2414}},{"into":"","node":{"t":"board","name":"annotations","o":{"dir":"column","align":"start","gap":"space.stack.sm","pad":"space.inset.lg","fill":"color.surface.canvas"},"kids":[{"t":"text","name":"title","chars":"E19-D01 / 06 approximated-partial-strip","typo":"type.ui.heading-sm","color":"color.text.primary","w":368},{"s":"b","name":"block-01","kids":[{"s":"c","name":"label","chars":"Board"},{"s":"a","name":"value-1","chars":"memo §0 L40: §6.4–§6.5, PD-4, PD-5: the header status slot with CMP-011 and CMP-227, the hatched approximated rows"},{"s":"a","name":"value-2","chars":"Frames: status/approximated-session, status/partial-composite, status/header-slot"},{"s":"a","name":"value-3","chars":"Theme: dark only — greyscale research board, no light twin (memo §0, BQ-15)"},{"s":"a","name":"value-4","chars":"Export: docs/design/research/img/E19-D01-06-approximated-partial-strip.png"},{"s":"a","name":"value-5","chars":"Data: synthetic only where a board draws a profile — a seeded world (seed 382): BTCUSDT 30-minute periods over the UTC days 28 Oct, 29 Oct, 30 Oct 2026 (the last developing, as of 14:30 UTC), tick 0.10 and qty step 0.001 from the recorded instrument fixture; prices, volumes and buy shares synthetic; rows of 50 ticks (5.0 USDT) unless a frame says otherwise; every POC, VAH, VAL, node, count and time derived from the periods (value area 70 %, `22`'s single-step expansion). Research board: greyscale, dark only; every finding (heuristic), every decision PROPOSED; no session was run."},{"s":"a","name":"value-6","chars":"AC 3 stays open: no misread exists to quote; the protocol records one verbatim (T9) — memo §6.4"}]},{"t":"clone","name":"block-02","of":"block-01","set":{"label":{"chars":"status/approximated-session"},"value-1":{"chars":"PD-4 (memo §7 L212, PROPOSED): An approximated profile cannot be read without its badge"},"value-2":{"chars":"F-4 (heuristic) [Major] (memo §3 L83): \"approximated from bars\" has no `EstimatedBadge` detector and is missing from `14`'s \"(estimated)\" rule list, though a bar-approximation member already has a precedent (`vwap_bar_approx`)"},"value-3":{"chars":"F-5 (heuristic) [Blocker] (memo §3 L84): No contract field says which period or which rows were bar-approximated: `DataMeta.sources` names tiers for the whole response, so the client cannot hatch the approximated rows"},"value-4":{"chars":"F-6 (heuristic) [Major] (memo §3 L85): An approximated POC depends on an allocation rule the trader cannot see: on the same 450 bars two rules move the POC by two rows (§4.1); delta cannot be derived from bars at all (tool `bars`: a kline carries no aggressor side)"},"value-5":{"chars":"Hatch reading (kit): a row is hatched when any of its volume is bar-approximated (G-3: no per-row flag exists yet)"},"value-6":{"chars":"TPO over the approximated portion: not drawn here (Volume input); PD-4 requires it absent too